WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:03.055
The security guard stared at Ally.

2
00:00:03.056 --> 00:00:08.105
"You just going to stand there, or are you coming in?" she asked gruffly.

3
00:00:08.106 --> 00:00:12.261
"Uh . . ." Ally hesitated. "Not yet. Thanks!"

4
00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:16.345
Ally spun around and skittered away.

5
00:00:16.346 --> 00:00:23.952
"I have to find a quiet place to think," she thought.

6
00:00:23.953 --> 00:00:27.779
She found a restroom around the corner and ducked inside.

7
00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:33.113
She was hoping it would be empty, but several humans were inside, adjusting their costumes.

8
00:00:33.114 --> 00:00:36.038
Ally looked closely at their costumes and makeup.

9
00:00:36.039 --> 00:00:41.343
One girl was dressed like a rocket ship, and the other one wore a pair of enormous ears.

10
00:00:41.344 --> 00:00:48.017
"Yikes," Ally thought. "Earthlings know nothing about the universe. Nobody has ears like that!"

11
00:00:48.018 --> 00:00:51.856
Ally looked at another costume.

12
00:00:51.857 --> 00:00:53.935
Suddenly she knew what she had to do.

13
00:00:53.936 --> 00:01:02.369
"It's risky," she thought, swallowing hard. "But it's my only choice."

14
00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:10.495
She stepped into one of the stalls and took off her meld medallion, instantly reverting to her Astralian form.

15
00:01:10.496 --> 00:01:15.701
As she stepped back out of the stall, she froze, waiting for someone to react to her appearance.

16
00:01:15.702 --> 00:01:18.532
But to her relief, no one even looked at her.

17
00:01:18.533 --> 00:01:22.651
Ally grinned and headed for the hallway. "It worked!" she thought.

18
00:01:22.652 --> 00:01:30.564
"Now I just need a hiding spot for my meld medallion so I can pass through the metal detector."

19
00:01:30.565 --> 00:01:35.057
She looked around and spotted a fire extinguisher.

20
00:01:35.058 --> 00:01:39.885
"No one will bother to look here," she thought, tucking the meld medallion behind it.

21
00:01:39.886 --> 00:01:42.380
"As long as there's no fire, that is."

22
00:01:42.381 --> 00:01:45.910
Ally started back to the gallery.

23
00:01:45.911 --> 00:01:48.630
On the way people kept stopping her.

24
00:01:48.631 --> 00:01:52.192
"Cool costume!" a tall alien said.

25
00:01:52.193 --> 00:01:58.392
"Yeah," a purple one agreed. "With that outfit, you could win the contest!"

26
00:01:58.393 --> 00:02:00.802
Ally nodded and gave a thumbs-up sign.

27
00:02:00.803 --> 00:02:06.590
But if everything went smoothly, she would be heading back to her pod with the parts in a few minutes.

28
00:02:06.591 --> 00:02:11.723
Ally marched past the guard, through the metal detector, and right into Dr. Lloyd's gallery.

29
00:02:11.724 --> 00:02:14.528
"I'm almost there!" she thought excitedly.

30
00:02:14.529 --> 00:02:17.590
But her excitement drained away a second later.

31
00:02:17.591 --> 00:02:21.601
"There are too many people here!" Ally thought.

32
00:02:21.602 --> 00:02:25.563
"There's no way I can sneak into his office without being seen.

33
00:02:25.564 --> 00:02:29.805
And the room is too crowded for me to use my voice-throwing ability."

34
00:02:29.806 --> 00:02:32.400
Just then Dr. Lloyd stepped up to a podium.

35
00:02:32.401 --> 00:02:35.453
To his right was a large box covered by a curtain. The

36
00:02:35.454 --> 00:02:37.966
lights dimmed and he began to speak. "Thank

37
00:02:37.967 --> 00:02:44.215
you for coming, sci-fi fans and extraterrestrial experts!" he said. "As

38
00:02:44.216 --> 00:02:49.800
many of you surely know, I've spent my entire career searching for alien life. While

39
00:02:49.801 --> 00:02:56.904
I believe there are several advanced civilizations in the universe, there is only one species who travels the universe, trying

40
00:02:56.905 --> 00:03:02.082
to establish peace and solve intergalactic disputes." Ally's

41
00:03:02.083 --> 00:03:05.721
stomach clenched. "Uh-oh," she thought. "Here

42
00:03:05.722 --> 00:03:10.314
it comes. He's going to reveal my secret to everyone." "I've

43
00:03:10.315 --> 00:03:15.190
devoted most of my studies to these beings," Dr. Lloyd continued. "And

44
00:03:15.191 --> 00:03:22.028
now, through extensive research, I can finally present to you . . . an up-close specimen!" Ally

45
00:03:22.029 --> 00:03:26.630
covered her face, certain that he was about to call her up onstage. But

46
00:03:26.631 --> 00:03:29.039
Dr. Lloyd didn't even look at her. Instead

47
00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:32.614
he pulled a cord on the curtain covering the box. It

48
00:03:32.615 --> 00:03:39.454
fell away to reveal . . . a figure made of wax! Ally

49
00:03:39.455 --> 00:03:47.211
slowly peeked out from behind her fingers. "The

50
00:03:47.212 --> 00:03:52.598
nose is wrong," she thought, "and its feet are way too small. But

51
00:03:52.599 --> 00:03:55.538
it does look a lot like an Astralian!" A

52
00:03:55.539 --> 00:03:58.751
good Astralian would speak up right now, Ally thought. An

53
00:03:58.752 --> 00:04:03.257
Astralian would never allow a human to spread false knowledge about the species. But

54
00:04:03.258 --> 00:04:06.327
as the humans began to move closer to view the wax figure, Ally

55
00:04:06.328 --> 00:04:15.606
was thinking of something else: this was her chance to slip into Dr. Lloyd's office. A

56
00:04:15.607 --> 00:04:17.627
moment later she was inside. She

57
00:04:17.628 --> 00:04:21.825
quietly closed the door behind her and pulled out the map printout. "According

58
00:04:21.826 --> 00:04:26.937
to this map, the parts should be in that cabinet," she murmured. She

59
00:04:26.938 --> 00:04:33.510
ran over and flung open the door. But to her horror, the cabinet was almost empty. The

60
00:04:33.511 --> 00:04:39.264
only thing inside was a small black box with an antenna and a red blinking light. "Not

61
00:04:39.265 --> 00:04:45.230
again!" Ally moaned. "This time Alpha got the location wrong!" She

62
00:04:45.231 --> 00:04:50.557
looked around and started frantically rummaging through other cabinets, hoping that she'd find the parts. Then—

63
00:04:50.558 --> 00:04:55.211
bam! She gasped as the door to the office flew open.

64
00:04:55.212 --> 00:05:00.461
A tall, thin woman with glasses and a scowl on her face was standing in the doorway of the office.

65
00:05:00.462 --> 00:05:04.915
"What are you doing in here?"

